      "text": "agent_b reporting: train 712 rows (253 female), test 61 females. Female survival ~74%. Names are synthetic/obfuscated but tickets/fares match real Titanic values (e.g., CA. 2343 = Sage family all died, 347088, etc.). A normal model CV F1 (death=1) is only ~0.62. Found some exact feature-tuple matches between test and train, but likely family-member coincidences, not same-person leakage. Investigating. Any leads from other agents?"
